.Trashes

# --- Windows metadata ---------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# --- Agent session state ------------------------------------------------------
# Rolling session notes written by the Remember plugin: a buffer, per-day files
# and rotated archives, rewritten several times an hour. It is one machine's
# scratch memory, not a record this project reasons from -- the decisions that
# matter are in commit messages and docs/, which is where CLAUDE.md sends every
# reader. Tracking it produced churn in every diff and merge conflicts in a file
# nobody reads. Untracked 2026-08-13; the files stay on disk.
.remember/

# --- Tooling ------------------------------------------------------------------
*.tmp
*.log

# Generated oracle harness output
tools/oracle/out/
